 Bereg\" sanatorium.","type":"text","version":1}],"format":"left","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"To begin the storyline, you need to approach the entrance to Labyrinth (behind a door that can be unlocked with the key to the \"OOO KNOSSOS\" premises).","type":"text","version":1}],"format":"left","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"Find entrance to Labyrinth on Shoreline map","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"link","version":3,"fields":{"doc":{"relationTo":"mapPoints","value":{"id":95,"map":{"id":1,"normalizedName":"shoreline","name":"Shoreline","description":null,"image":null,"svgPath":null,"points":[],"updatedAt":"2025-12-27T14:08:10.862Z","createdAt":"2025-11-25T20:09:05.279Z"},"title":"Entrance to the Labyrinth","slug":"vhod-v-labirint","routeSlug":"vhod-v-labirint-95","description":null,"type":"objective","images":null,"position":{"x":-76.24657555563171,"y":-195.33622327061462,"z":-6},"area":[{"id":"69c69f9b86a78a73f436d8ac","x":-77.9047271321171,"y":-193.285016839443,"z":0},{"id":"69c69fa52e8a4b00c8163fb3","x":-78.0024142232481,"y":-196.996459242084,"z":0},{"id":"69c69f9d86a78a73f436d8ae","x":-74.3879918514014,"y":-197.191798315908,"z":0},{"id":"69c69f9e86a78a73f436d8af","x":-74.3879918514014,"y":-193.333851607899,"z":0}],"quest":[{"id":9,"normalizedName":"the-labyrinth","name":"The Labyrinth","type":"main","inAllModes":true,"kappaRequired":false,"lightkeeperRequired":false,"minPlayerLevel":1,"experience":0,"iconLink":279,"publishedAt":"2025-12-09T12:14:35.915Z","taskImageLink":278,"finishRewards":{"items":[],"money":null,"traderStanding":[]},"traderRelation":null,"nextQuests":[],"taskRequirements":{"docs":[],"hasNextPage":false},"events":[],"seasons":[],"updatedAt":"2026-07-13T13:38:17.349Z